@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Status: total sightings and the latest sync run
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### Health (Spring Actuator)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health


### Reference: known cities with region and coordinates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reference/cities

### Reference: known species with latin name and guide
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reference/species


### Sync: start a manual sync (202, runs in the background)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sync

> {% client.global.set("runId", response.body.runId); %}

### Sync: poll the run just started
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/runs/{{runId}}

### Sync: latest 20 runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/runs

### Sync: records rejected during syncs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/rejected?page=0&size=20

### Sync: unknown run (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sync/runs/999999


### Sightings: newest first, default page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings

### Sightings: one city in a date range, oldest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings?city=London&from=2023-01-01&to=2023-12-31&sort=oldest

### Sightings: by region and species, case-insensitive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings?region=scotland&species=marsh%20tick&size=5

### Sightings: species by latin name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings?species=Ixodes%20canisuga&size=5

### Sightings: invalid filters (400 with field errors)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings?city=Atlantis&from=2024-12-31&to=2024-01-01&sort=sideways

### Sightings: report a new sighting (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sightedAt"

2024-06-01T10:30:00
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="city"

leeds
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="species"

Marsh tick
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Found on a dog after a walk
--boundary--

> {% client.global.set("sightingId", response.body.id); %}

### Sightings: get the one just reported
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings/{{sightingId}}

### Sightings: report the same sighting again (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sightedAt"

2024-06-01T10:30:00
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="city"

Leeds
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="species"

Marsh tick
--boundary--

### Sightings: invalid report (400: future date, unknown city and species)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sightedAt"

2099-01-01T00:00:00
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="city"

Atlantis
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="species"

Dragon tick
--boundary--

### Sightings: unknown id (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sightings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### Insights: summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/summary

### Insights: per region
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/by-region

### Insights: per city in 2024
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/by-city?from=2024-01-01&to=2024-12-31

### Insights: per species in Scotland
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/by-species?region=Scotland

### Insights: monthly trend, gaps filled with zero
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/trends?interval=month

### Insights: weekly trend for London in 2024
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/trends?interval=week&city=London&from=2024-01-01&to=2024-12-31

### Insights: yearly trend
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/trends?interval=year

### Insights: seasonal pattern (all 12 months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/seasonal

### Insights: unknown interval (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/trends?interval=fortnight


### Predictions: forecast the next 6 months
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/predictions/forecast

### Predictions: forecast 12 months for one city and species
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/predictions/forecast?city=Manchester&species=Marsh%20tick&months=12

### Predictions: back-test against simple baselines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/predictions/forecast/evaluation

### Predictions: anomalies by city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/predictions/anomalies

### Predictions: anomalies by region at a looser threshold
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/predictions/anomalies?level=region&alpha=0.1

### Predictions: out-of-range months (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/predictions/forecast?months=36
